{"id":"wb-4-75","name":"海瑞墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"海瑞墓","text":"海瑞墓，位于中华人民共和国海南省海口市龙华区海垦街道丘海大道39号，是明代被誉为“海青天”的官员海瑞的墓地。该墓建成于万历十七年（1589年），文革期间一度被毁，后得以重修。1996年，海瑞墓被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B5%B7%E7%91%9E%E5%A2%93","revisionId":92413430,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92413430","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e79cc71319e28bb28f25a43d.jpg","title":"Tomb_of_Hai_Rui_1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tomb_of_Hai_Rui_1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9e/Tomb_of_Hai_Rui_1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Pavel Kromer's Whole Lotta Trouble","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","caption":"​海南海口海瑞墓","width":320,"height":240}}